error
# Issue #1494: a recorded prior worker for the issue remained alive after
# the pre-launch reap attempt — either the guarded process-tree kill
# failed, the pid was live with no process-start fingerprint to kill
# against, or it was still alive on the post-kill recheck. The replacement
# rework launch was refused and recorded as a ``prior_worker_still_alive``
# blocked-environment failure, so error is correct: dispatch did not
# happen and a human may need to terminate the process manually.
